<title>USA: Pacificare, FHP close merger.</title>
<headline>Pacificare, FHP close merger.</headline>
<dateline>CYPRESS, Calif. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>PacifiCare Health Systems Inc on Friday said it completed its $2.2 billion acquisition of FHP International Corp.</p>
<p>The combined company will serve nearly four million commercial and Medicare members in 15 states and Guam.</p>
</text>
